#: ../../how-to/add-modulation.md:1
msgid "添加新的调制方式"
msgstr "Adding a New Modulation Scheme"

#: ../../how-to/add-modulation.md:3
msgid "本指南说明如何在 nearlink-sdr 框架中添加一种新的调制方式。"
msgstr ""
"This guide explains how to add a new modulation scheme to the nearlink-sdr "
"framework."

#: ../../how-to/add-modulation.md:5
msgid "步骤"
msgstr "Steps"

#: ../../how-to/add-modulation.md:7
msgid "1. 在 `src/nearlink_sdr/phy/` 下创建模块"
msgstr "1. Create a module under `src/nearlink_sdr/phy/`"

#: ../../how-to/add-modulation.md:9
msgid ""
"参照 `gfsk.py` 或 `psk.py` 的结构, 创建调制器和解调器类。每个调制器类至少实现 `modulate()` 方法, 解调器至少实现 "
"`demodulate()` 方法:"
msgstr ""
"Following the structure of `gfsk.py` or `psk.py`, create modulator and "
"demodulator classes. Each modulator must implement at least a `modulate()` "
"method, and each demodulator must implement at least a `demodulate()` "
"method:"

#: ../../how-to/add-modulation.md:17
msgid "2. 在 `tests/` 下创建对应的测试文件"
msgstr "2. Create a corresponding test file under `tests/`"

#: ../../how-to/add-modulation.md:19
msgid "测试文件命名为 `test_<模块名>.py`, 覆盖核心功能:"
msgstr ""
"Name the test file `test_<module_name>.py` and cover the core functionality:"

#: ../../how-to/add-modulation.md:21
msgid "调制输出长度和类型"
msgstr "Modulation output length and type"

#: ../../how-to/add-modulation.md:22
msgid "往返一致性 (调制 → 解调 → 比较)"
msgstr "Round-trip consistency (modulate → demodulate → compare)"

#: ../../how-to/add-modulation.md:23
msgid "不同输入长度的边界条件"
msgstr "Boundary conditions for various input lengths"

#: ../../how-to/add-modulation.md:25
msgid "示例测试结构:"
msgstr "Example test structure:"

#: ../../how-to/add-modulation.md:33
msgid "3. 注册到 TX/RX 流水线"
msgstr "3. Register in the TX/RX pipeline"

#: ../../how-to/add-modulation.md:35
msgid ""
"在 `phy/tx_pipeline.py` 的 `tx_chain()` 函数中, 根据 `cfg.frame_type` 分支添加新调制方式:"
msgstr ""
"In the `tx_chain()` function of `phy/tx_pipeline.py`, add the new modulation"
" scheme under the `cfg.frame_type` branch:"

#: ../../how-to/add-modulation.md:43
msgid ""
"在 `phy/rx_pipeline.py` 的 `rx_chain()` 中添加对应的解调分支。如果新调制方式需要新的 MCS 配置, 还需更新 "
"`common/mcs.py` 中的 MCS 映射表。"
msgstr ""
"Add the corresponding demodulation branch in `phy/rx_pipeline.py`'s "
"`rx_chain()`. If the new modulation scheme requires a new MCS configuration,"
" also update the MCS mapping table in `common/mcs.py`."

#: ../../how-to/add-modulation.md:45
msgid "4. 运行验证"
msgstr "4. Run validation"

#: ../../how-to/add-modulation.md:47
msgid "确保 lint 和测试全部通过:"
msgstr "Ensure that lint and all tests pass:"
